  RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", "\[Ellipsis]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"f1001010-ffff-4010-aaaa-600000000010"],
 " on each vertex of the graph form, whereas the ",
